<title>USA: World Airways names Ray interim president.</title>
<headline>World Airways names Ray interim president.</headline>
<dateline>HERNDON, Va. 1997-04-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>World Airways Inc said Friday it had named Russell Ray Jr as interim president and chief executive, succeeding Charles Pollard.</p>
<p>Pollard stepped down in March to pursue other interests.</p>
<p>Ray has served on World's board for four years.</p>
<p>World is 61 percent owned by WorldCorp Inc, 18 percent by MHS Berhad of Malaysia, and 21 percent by public investors.</p>
